  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups chicken broth, divided",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh chives",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.125 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "1.5 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "2 eggs",
    "1 egg yolk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/baz0QRS3j4tbLQg3FDL5_cg3rN0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45515-restaurant-style-egg-drop-soup-ddmfs-Step-01-1074b1f31d5c434088ff8577d946fdc6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45515/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reserve 3/4 cup of chicken broth, and pour the rest into a large saucepan. Stir in chives, salt, and ginger; bring to a rolling boil. Stir reserved 3/4 cup of broth and cornstarch until smooth. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kURcyBH38ycO98HYsjDdk5iT70s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45515-restaurant-style-egg-drop-soup-ddmfs-Step-02-a86bcc6d1fa6400dadc85f36f60d24ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45515/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs and egg yolk together in a small bowl with a fork. Using a fork, drizzle eggs, a little at a time, into boiling broth. Eggs will cook immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tXFzZck9OmeFbk3Rn6YYwJAar-g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45515-restaurant-style-egg-drop-soup-ddmfs-Step-03-6d3cfcbd58bb4017bd5092900c8d93eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45515/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in cornstarch mixture gradually until soup reaches desired consistency.",
